#: src/ai/edit-prediction.md:226
msgid "\"alt-l\""
msgstr ""

#: src/ai/edit-prediction.md:232
msgid ""
"If you would like to use the default keybinding, you can free it up by "
"either moving yours to a more specific context or changing it to something "
